BT /F2 16 Tf 48.0 649.2 Td (XTAL 671) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 622.4 Td (Compensates for manufacturing tolerances in the radio?s base crystal oscillator.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 606.4 Td (The reference oscillator should ideally produce 26.000000 MHz, but in practice it will always) Tj ET
