BT /F1 10 Tf 60.0 486.5 Td (- Actual tuned frequency: 441.99490 MHz) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 470.5 Td (This results in a 5.1 kHz error.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 454.5 Td (This is by far the most common cause of ?non-bug? reports where:) Tj ET
