BT /F1 10 Tf 60.0 422.5 Td (- RX DCS fails entirely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 406.5 Td (CTCSS generally requires accuracy within ~1 kHz, and DCS within ~500 Hz, making proper) Tj ET
