BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 461.4 Td (Bytes: 0xAA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 445.4 Td (The RADIO replies with the same byte \(0xAA\). This keeps both directions active and prevents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 48.0 432.4 Td (timeouts.) Tj ET
